# Consent + CSP

## Consent (do not “simplify”)
- **Consent Mode v2:** default `denied` for ad/analytics storage in EEA/UK/CH until the CMP updates (`BaseLayout.astro` + `src/lib/gdprRegions.ts`). Defaults must run before any `gtag('config')`.
- **EEA / UK / CH:** Google Funding Choices / AdSense Privacy & messaging is the **only** CMP UI. Suppress the first-party cookie bar. Load gtag.js with denied defaults (Advanced Consent Mode); do not use the site Accept path.
- **Elsewhere:** site Accept/Reject cookie bar only (no Google CMP message). Load gtag.js only after Accept (or a prior Accept in `yc_cookie_ok`); grant Consent Mode **before** the first `config` so `page_view` is not dropped; if already configured under denied, send an explicit `page_view` on Accept.
- Geo signal: Worker injects `<meta name="yt-geo-country">` from `request.cf.country` (`src/worker.ts`, `src/lib/htmlGeoInject.ts`).
- Privacy copy must stay aligned with AdSense cookies + opt-out + this split (`src/pages/privacy.astro`, `docs/ADSENSE.md`).

## CSP (`public/_headers`)
Keep the allowlist **narrow**. Comment in `_headers` explains each host. Required families:

| Hosts | Why |
|---|---|
| `googletagmanager.com`, `google-analytics.com`, `*.g.doubleclick.net`, `*.google.com` | GA4 / Google Signals |
| `*.googlesyndication.com`, `*.adtrafficquality.google`, `fundingchoicesmessages.google.com` | AdSense + Funding Choices CMP |
| `fonts.googleapis.com`, `fonts.gstatic.com` | Funding Choices UI fonts/styles |
| `static.cloudflareinsights.com`, `cloudflareinsights.com` | Cloudflare Web Analytics |

**Do not** loosen to `*` / broad CDNs “just in case”. Add a host only with a named product reason and a matching comment. CSP changes are their own careful PR — never casual drive-bys.
